OL,3,GNEWSAOptimism after draft includes
OL,4,Ascrapping red tape
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is optimism among food exporters
OL,7,Fin south-west England after the UK and
OL,8,FEU agreed a draft deal this week that
OL,9,Fcould remove post-Brexit checks from
OL,10,Ffood and agriculture exports.
OL,12,FThe draft includes removing the need
OL,13,Ffor #200 export health certificates
OL,14,Falong with inspections and monthly
OL,15,Fwater purification tests.
OL,17,FIf finalised at the EU summit later
OL,18,Fthis month, it could see an end to
OL,19,Fexpensive export certificates and
OL,20,Fpaperwork and also bring back pet
OL,21,Fpassports.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
