OL,3,GNEWSAOptimism after draft includes
OL,4,Ascrapping red tape
OL,5,
OL,6,FNikki Holmyard, owner of the Offshore
OL,7,FShellfish, in Brixham, said: "We're not
OL,8,Fout of the woods yet but at least we'll
OL,9,Fbe on the right side of things once the
OL,10,Fagreement is done we'll know that it's
OL,11,Four government to nag."
